# 📊 Student Performance Data Intelligence System

**StuDI System** is a data-driven student performance analytics system designed to analyze academic performance and provide meaningful insights through an interactive web dashboard.

The system analyzes **study hours, attendance, assignment scores, final marks, and student results** using Python-based data analysis and machine learning, combined with a modern React dashboard.

---

## 🎯 Project Objective

The main objective of the **Student Performance Data Intelligence System** is to transform student academic data into meaningful insights.

It helps analyze student performance, identify relationships between different academic factors, visualize performance trends, and classify students based on their results.

