📊 Dataset

The system uses a student performance dataset containing:

Feature	Description
Student_ID	Unique student identifier
Study_Hours	Number of hours studied
Attendance	Student attendance percentage
Assignment_Score	Assignment performance score
Final_Marks	Final examination marks
Result	Pass or Fail
📈 Data Analysis

The Python analysis performs:

Average final marks
Highest final marks
Lowest final marks
Median final marks
Standard deviation
Missing-value analysis
Study Hours vs Final Marks visualization
Attendance vs Final Marks visualization
Pass vs Fail distribution
Correlation heatmap
🤖 Machine Learning

The project uses Logistic Regression for student result classification.

Input Features
Study Hours
Attendance
Assignment Score
Target
Fail → 0
Pass → 1

The model predicts whether a student is likely to be classified as Pass or Fail based on the selected academic features.

Note: The current dataset is a small demonstration dataset, so the reported model accuracy should not be interpreted as real-world performance.

